Further details on Microsoft Project Solara, reference hardware,

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.700
and early enterprise pilots are expected in the coming weeks.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:47.640
Additional codex domain plugins are likely as open AI iterates on the plugin framework.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.960
Expanded Project Glass-Wayne cohort announcements from Anthropic are expected

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.640
as the program scales.

